Have you been crowned yet?  You can get unrestricted in any weapon
class (i.e. firearms) if you follow the correct procedure before/
during crowning.

Ok, you seem pretty set.  There are still some items that you will
really want to have.
1) Amulet of flying - lots of fun - the lawful quest always has one,
did you pick it up?
2) I was going to suggest an amulet of unchanging, but a high-level
doppelganger really doesn't need it.
3) Reflection - how do you handle it?  Nighthorn? Shield? Amulet?
4) Spells - you NEED charm monster. Haste self is very helpful.
Jumping is great. Passwall is da bomb! Skilled detect monster is
awesome.  Magic mapping speeds things up a lot.
5) Level-drain resistance, how are you protecting yourself?
6) Firearms - do you have an assault rifle and a big pile of ammo yet?
7) How many HP do you have?  Did you clear the Guild of disgruntled
adventurers level yet?
8) Drowning is a BIG danger in slashem.  If you don't have flying,
fireproof water walking boots are better than jumping or speed,
especially if you have the jumping and haste self spells.

